 decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"901\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/AI-Landscape-in-Cambodia-727x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-31150\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/AI-Landscape-in-Cambodia-727x1024.png 727w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/AI-Landscape-in-Cambodia-213x300.png 213w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/AI-Landscape-in-Cambodia.png 767w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-609ae9c2\" data-id=\"609ae9c2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28cd22eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"28cd22eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Title<\/strong>: <a href=\"https:\/\/misti.gov.kh\/public\/file\/202305301685413730.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AI Landscape in Cambodia<\/a><br \/><strong>Year<\/strong>: 2023<br \/><strong>Type<\/strong>: Book<br \/><strong>Authors<\/strong>: Chhem Kieth Rethy; Hul Seingheng;\u00a0Alamgir Hossain; <br \/>Chhem Siriwat; Chea Vatana; Long Pakrigna; Khieng Sothy; Prum Sophea<br \/><strong><br \/>Abstract: <\/strong>&#8220;AI is a rapidly developing field with the potential to transform many aspects of society. Cambodia is still in the early stages of AI development, but there are many opportunities for this technology to benefit the country. Some of the industries that are seen as benefiting from AI in Cambodia are healthcare, education, and finance. However, there are also challenges that come with the use of AI. These challenges include the need for specialized skills and expertise, as well as the need to address ethical and privacy concerns. Additionally, there is a concern that AI will take jobs away from unskilled or easily automated workers. In order to foster trustworthy AI ecosystems, it is essential for countries to develop human-centered policies that promote socio-economic and responsible AI research and development. These policies should take into account the country&#8217;s national development vision as well as regional and global trends.&#8221;<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-cbec409 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"cbec409\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-68e5879\" data-id=\"68e5879\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-826f364 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"826f364\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/AI-Cambodia-Forum-Summary-Report-1.pdf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"895\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/1st-Annual-Forum-AI-Cambodia-732x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-31207\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/1st-Annual-Forum-AI-Cambodia-732x1024.png 732w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/1st-Annual-Forum-AI-Cambodia-214x300.png 214w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/1st-Annual-Forum-AI-Cambodia-768x1074.png 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/1st-Annual-Forum-AI-Cambodia.png 772w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-ecc8100\" data-id=\"ecc8100\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10206ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"10206ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Title<\/strong>: <a href=\"https:\/\/misti.gov.kh\/public\/file\/202305301685413730.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1st Annual Forum AI-Cambodia<\/a><br \/><strong>Year<\/strong>: 2018<br \/><strong>Type<\/strong>: Report<br \/><strong>Authors<\/strong>: Chhem Siriwat<br \/><strong><br \/>Abstract:\u00a0 <\/strong>This is the report of the 1st Annual AI-Cambodia Forum: \u201cHuman Intelligence in the Augmented Era\u201d which was held on Thursday, November 8th, 2018 at Raintree \u2013 the Canopy, Phnom Penh, Cambodia. The forum was sponsored by the Cambodia Development Resource Institute (CDRI), ISI Group, and the Institute of Technology of Cambodia (ITC). The report summarizes key points of the forum objectives, expected outcomes, scholar and entrepreneur presentations, discussions, and recommendations. The forum was attended by 38 participants from key technical institutions and private sectors. These included executive directors, senior managers, scholars, entrepreneurs, and students. Based on the participants\u2019 feedback, there were generally positive responses that the knowledge gained from participating in the forum met their expectations and more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-245e3e5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"245e3e5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2cb4014 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"2cb4014\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>AI Insights Title: AI Landscape in CambodiaYear: 2023Type: BookAuthors: Chhem Kieth Rethy; Hul Seingheng;\u00a0Alamgir Hossain; Chhem Siriwat; Chea Vatana; Long Pakrigna; Khieng Sothy; Prum SopheaAbstract: &#8220;AI is a rapidly developing field with the potential to transform many aspects of society. Cambodia is still in the early stages of AI development, but there are many opportunities for this technology to benefit the country. Some of the industries that are seen as benefiting from AI in Cambodia are healthcare, education, and finance. However, there are also challenges that come with the use of AI. These challenges include the need for specialized skills and expertise, as well as the need to address ethical and privacy concerns. Additionally, there is a concern that AI will take jobs away from unskilled or easily automated workers. In order to foster trustworthy AI ecosystems, it is essential for countries to develop human-centered policies that promote socio-economic and responsible AI research and development. These policies should take into account the country&#8217;s national development vision as well as regional and global trends.&#8221; \u00a0 Title: 1st Annual Forum AI-CambodiaYear: 2018Type: ReportAuthors: Chhem SiriwatAbstract:\u00a0 This is the report of the 1st Annual AI-Cambodia Forum: \u201cHuman Intelligence in the Augmented Era\u201d which was held on Thursday, November 8th, 2018 at Raintree \u2013 the Canopy, Phnom Penh, Cambodia. The forum was sponsored by the Cambodia Development Resource Institute (CDRI), ISI Group, and the Institute of Technology of Cambodia (ITC). The report summarizes key points of the forum objectives, expected outcomes, scholar and entrepreneur presentations, discussions, and recommendations. The forum was attended by 38 participants from key technical institutions and private sectors. These included executive directors, senior managers, scholars, entrepreneurs, and students. Based on the participants\u2019 feedback, there were generally positive responses that the knowledge gained from participating in the forum met their expectations and more.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-31144","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/31144","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/7"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/